  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In another part of Starry Sky grotto-heaven, a rocky giant as tall as a hill smashes a desolate beast flying bear to the ground. Immortal killer move Earth’s Root is named. From the center of his two palms, earth qi bubbles. Countless thick and sharp earth spikes protrude from the ground like spears. Hundreds of those spikes pierce the flying bear, and it dies. Light then leaves the rocky giant. A Gu Immortal with short white hair and golden pupils stands in the air. Star Lord Wan Xiang praises Immortal Monkey King. The white haired man with golden pupils is rank seven Combat Immortal Sect Gu Immortal Shi Lei.",
      "chapters": [
        716
      ],
